#: ../../legacy/index.rst:2
msgid "The CMUcam project"
msgstr "Projekt CMUcam"

#: ../../legacy/index.rst:4
msgid "*Open Source Programmable Embedded Color Vision Sensors*"
msgstr "*Programabilni ugrađeni senzori vida u boji otvorenog koda*"

#: ../../legacy/index.rst:6
msgid ""
"Before the OpenMV Cam, there was the CMUcam. Beginning in 2000 at `Carnegie "
"Mellon University <http://www.cmu.edu/>`__, the CMUcam line put real-time "
"machine vision into a small, low-cost, low-power sensor -- something a hobby"
" robot or an 8-bit microcontroller could talk to over a plain serial port. "
"Five generations followed over the next fourteen years, from the original "
"CMUcam1 through to Pixy (CMUcam5)."
msgstr ""
"Prije OpenMV Cama, postojao je CMUcam. Počevši 2000. godine na `Sveučilištu "
"Carnegie Mellon <http://www.cmu.edu/>`__, linija CMUcam stavila je strojni "
"vid u stvarnom vremenu u mali senzor niske cijene i niske potrošnje -- nešto"
" s čime bi hobistički robot ili 8-bitni mikrokontroler mogao komunicirati "
"preko običnog serijskog priključka. Pet generacija uslijedilo je tijekom "
"sljedećih četrnaest godina, od izvornog CMUcam1 pa do Pixyja (CMUcam5)."

#: ../../legacy/index.rst:15
msgid ""
"The OpenMV Cam grew directly out of that lineage: the same idea of an open-"
"source, self-contained vision sensor for embedded systems, carried forward "
"onto modern microcontrollers and MicroPython. The connection is direct -- "
"the hands-on experience behind the later CMUcams went straight into building"
" the OpenMV Cam."
msgstr ""
"OpenMV Cam izrastao je izravno iz te loze: ista ideja o vizijskom senzoru "
"otvorenog koda, samostalnom, za ugrađene sustave, prenesena na moderne "
"mikrokontrolere i MicroPython. Veza je izravna -- praktično iskustvo iza "
"kasnijih CMUcamova otišlo je izravno u izradu OpenMV Cama."

#: ../../legacy/index.rst:22
msgid ""
"The original site, ``cmucam.org``, has since gone offline. These pages "
"preserve its camera overviews, wikis, and downloads for historical purposes,"
" so the work is not lost. The text is reproduced from the original site with"
" only minor cleanup."
msgstr ""
"Originalna stranica, ``cmucam.org``, u međuvremenu je otišla izvan mreže. "
"Ove stranice čuvaju njezine preglede kamera, wikije i preuzimanja u "
"povijesne svrhe, kako rad ne bi bio izgubljen. Tekst je reproduciran s "
"originalne stranice uz samo manja pročišćavanja."

#: ../../legacy/index.rst:29
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Pregled"

#: ../../legacy/index.rst:31
msgid ""
"The goal of the CMUcam project is to provide simple vision capabilities to "
"small embedded systems in the form of an intelligent sensor. The CMUcam open"
" source programmable embedded color vision sensors are low-cost, low-power "
"sensors for mobile robots. You can use the CMUcam vision systems to do many "
"different kinds of on-board, real-time vision processing tasks."
msgstr ""
"Cilj projekta CMUcam je pružiti jednostavne vizijske mogućnosti malim "
"ugrađenim sustavima u obliku inteligentnog senzora. CMUcam programabilni "
"ugrađeni senzori vida u boji otvorenog koda jeftini su senzori niske "
"potrošnje za mobilne robote. CMUcam vizijske sustave možete koristiti za "
"obavljanje mnogo različitih vrsta ugrađenih zadataka obrade vida u stvarnom "
"vremenu."

